This is a ROS2 humble workspace.
The language is Python or C++
The ROS2 packages have been sourced.
This project is for the yahboomcar X3 with the S2 lidar and the astra pro plus camera
There are two other workspaces that have relevent context:
    ~/yahboomcar_ros2/yahboom_X3_lib - contains the rosmaster library
    ~/yahboomcar_ros2/library_ws - contains the lidar and Astra Pro Plus camera packages
All test files should start with test_